@startuml
left to right direction
actor Applicant
actor Underwriter
actor Compliance

Applicant -> System: Submit application
System -> Applicant: Show ARN
System -> AI: Trigger scoring
AI -> System: Return score (UC-001)
AI -> System: Return recommendation (UC-001)
System -> Experian: Request credit report
System -> Underwriter: Route REFER_TO_UNDERWRITER (UC-002)
Underwriter -> System: Approve/Decline/Request info (UC-003)
System -> DocuSign: Generate offer
System -> T24: Trigger disbursement (UC-004)
System -> Compliance: Perform AML/KYC screening (UC-005)
Experian -> System: Return credit report summary (UC-006)
System -> Applicant: Send email/portal notifications (UC-007)
System -> Admin: Emit metrics and monitoring events (UC-008)

@enduml